Package: lstrrr
Title: Functional Tools for Working with Complex and Deeply Nested 'R' Lists
Version: 0.1.1
Authors@R: c(
    person("Yuxi", "Yang", , "15364051195@163.com", role = c("aut", "cre")))
Description: Provides a suite of functional programming tools for working
    with deeply nested R lists. Includes core accessors to read, write, and
    query nested structures by path.
